## Why This Is Asked
Tests the ability to design end-to-end privacy-preserving data pipelines with real-time orchestration, a combination of managed ML endpoints, and robust governance controls.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven ingestion (S3, EventBridge/Step Functions)
- Privacy: PII redaction, customerIdHash, encryption at rest/transit, retention policies
- Observability: Dead-letter queues, retry logic with exponential backoff, CloudWatch metrics
- Data governance: Cross-region replication, IAM least-privilege access, compliance requirements

